<title>USA: FINOVA Group unit sells $100 mln notes.</title>
<headline>FINOVA Group unit sells $100 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from FINOVA Capital Corp, a unit of FINOVA Group Inc was priced on Monday, according to lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p>FINOVA Capital Corp is the principal subsidiary of the commercial finance company FINOVA Group Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER FINOVA Capital Corp</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 6.90 PCT   MATURITY 6/19/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.973  FIRST PAY DATE 12/19/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 6.905 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>S&amp;P A-MINUS	  SPREAD 55 BPS     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
